{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combine the elements!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each element can combine with any other element to create a unique effect or be applied as a debuff.\u00a0 Carry an arsenal of flasks to throw and attune your staff to whichever element you prefer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/5bb9645a4a4387324fc75e55234502ce.poster.avif?t=1753889532\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/5bb9645a4a4387324fc75e55234502ce.webm?t=1753889532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/5bb9645a4a4387324fc75e55234502ce.mp4?t=1753889532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Control your army of witches...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take over the world by moving your armies to control strategic resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/87f05a31fcabd84c3821851cf53e76c7.poster.avif?t=1753889532\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/87f05a31fcabd84c3821851cf53e76c7.webm?t=1753889532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/87f05a31fcabd84c3821851cf53e76c7.mp4?t=1753889532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">...And then choose a battle to join on the front lines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/5665719192253cc7b1c7e1c90c3c5fa4.poster.avif?t=1753889532\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/5665719192253cc7b1c7e1c90c3c5fa4.webm?t=1753889532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/5665719192253cc7b1c7e1c90c3c5fa4.mp4?t=1753889532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CAUSE MAYHEM AND CRUSH YOUR ENEMIES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Capture all of the bases or reduce the opponents reinforcements to 0 before they do the same to you.\u00a0 The opening state of the battle depends on how many soldiers you send to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/a7ff025b0f6d62bbd63d24b5fc06fcdc.poster.avif?t=1753889532\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/a7ff025b0f6d62bbd63d24b5fc06fcdc.webm?t=1753889532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/a7ff025b0f6d62bbd63d24b5fc06fcdc.mp4?t=1753889532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You don't have to fight alone.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your witch army is here to assist!\u00a0 Or perhaps you prefer to recruit your friends in online co-op*?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*friends not included</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/66f512eed18d79fac1dd218ecd02db16.poster.avif?t=1753889532\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai